$DATUM Kobayashi, Kenichi; Kobayashi, Yukiko; Nakamura, Misato; Tamura, Osamu;
Kogen, Hiroshi
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of Organic Chemistry (2015), 80(2), 1243-1248

